### Complexity Metrics

| Operation | Time Complexity | Space Complexity | Reason |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Dual Stack Processing** | **O(n)** | **O(n)** | Where `n` is the length of the fully decoded string output. The algorithm reads each input character once and builds the expanded string segment iteratively via direct buffer modifications. |

