## Key Insight

Pushing outer string buffers along with numeric multipliers onto dual stacks matches nested bracket limits dynamically, resolving complex multi-tier dependencies in optimal linear time.

```text
Time  : O(n) linear complexity relative to the decoded string length
Space : O(n) memory allocation footprint for stack buffers
```

